  (text "Tamper enclosure contents: FPGA signing module, STM32U5 supervisor, sensors, battery (SYSTEM_DESIGN 3)."
    (at 20.32 175.26 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "de0b6ecc-5c4d-455f-8ef5-de09a20ca4c7")
  )
  (text "SoC <-> FPGA: SPI mode 0 up to 12.5 MHz (ECSPI), every command and response HMAC'd (IF-02, protocol 0xB3). SoC never sees S."
    (at 20.32 180.34 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "c8101592-6b3a-43df-bf9a-795bb9e10e1d")
  )
  (text "Supervisor -> FPGA: receive-only SPI frame 0xA5||S, tamper line (fail-safe pull-up), ceremony pin (fail-closed pull-down)."
    (at 20.32 185.42 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "7fbbc428-5314-47bd-bca5-12bdabffe1ab")
  )
  (text "Decisions made for this draft (verify): XC7A50T-FTG256 with BBRAM key on VCCBATT; FPGA only (no SE050); UART for IF-05;"
    (at 20.32 190.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "fd4a1d93-660d-480c-a8e3-c2ab7714e896")
  )
  (text "  BAT54C diode-OR instead of TPS2117; ADXL363 instead of AIS328DQ; KSZ9031RNX instead of DP83825I; generic GbE magjack and"
    (at 20.32 195.58 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "3aaadf89-15f7-4802-9a9f-79d7a513cc00")
  )
  (text "  functional SOM symbol (pin numbers to be mapped). Mesh pair 1 on hardware TAMP, pairs 2-4 GPIO-scanned (LQFP64 has 3 TAMP pins)."
    (at 20.32 199.39 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "2002a8cf-bd5c-46ca-9f32-8a7f2f1c4e1e")
  )
